# Git / PR instructions

- The canonical remote for this repo is `git@github.com:getlark/larkci-cli.git` (formerly `uselark`).
- Before pushing or creating PRs, verify the remote URL with `git remote get-url origin` and update it if it still points to the old `uselark` org:
  ```bash
  git remote set-url origin git@github.com:getlark/larkci-cli.git
  ```
- The default branch is `main`.
